WEBVTT

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:04.910
Mysteria Friends

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.500
A Slice of Life

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:13.130
Okay, please wait a little longer.

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:15.040
Thank you, Hanna.

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:18.580
Oh, it's the princess.

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:20.170
Anne?

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.170
I can't believe this...

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:24.770
Why?

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.270
What's wrong?

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.710
"What's wrong"? You can't be serious!

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:29.900
Huh?

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:39.460
I literally BEGGED to see inside your room,
but you never let me!

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.170
What is this all about?

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:42.830
I'm not talking to you, Hanna!

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:46.500
There's no need to be rude, Anne.

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.330
Oh dear. What has gotten into you two?

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:10.210
Hanna.

00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:13.290
You still haven't worked it out?

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.790
What does it matter anyway?

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:23.180
I asked the repair person to come, Grea.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:26.080
Would you join me in your 
room while they work?

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.830
Okay, sure.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:28.580
Huh?

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:30.920
H-huh...?

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:41.380
Uh... um... well, I...

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:46.880
Let's go, Hanna.

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:47.640
Right.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:01.380
Ugh, I got it all wrong!

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:14.290
Roll the snow, roll it up,
and you get a snowman! Roll the sn-

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:17.710
Okay everyone, open your books.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:22.790
Today we'll be talking about how healing magic
can be used to clear your mind.

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:29.460
Holy magic is usually best known for its defense
and purification effects upon the body.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:31.670
Okay, next page.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:38.000
But research has shown it has tremendous
capabilities beyond the physical.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:42.670
This has been supported by experiments
performed with holy magic since ancient times.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:49.200
It not only heals the body but also can help those
who feel down, lifting them out of their funk.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.130
What makes this possible are the spirits...

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:51.210
Anne...
What makes this possible are the spirits...

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:57.960
Um, the spirits and their power,
which we borrow through forging a pact...

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.340
Okay, that's all for today.

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.930
Make sure to review your notes.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:18.670
What do you want to do after school today?

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:19.500
Let's go to that one place.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:20.040
What place?

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.630
You know, the one that we...

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.960
Hey, Anne. Look over-

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:39.750
Why did this have to happen?

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.580
Anne.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.580
Were you playing... the piano?

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.080
Yeah.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.130
But it's really cold.

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:43.420
And my hands... numbed up.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:21.580
Let's go have some tea.

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:29.290
Sure!

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:41.010
Episode 10
The Pair's Promise

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:41.010
Mysteria Friends, episode 
10: "The Pair's Promise."

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:46.000
Illustration by: Kenji Mizuta

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:50.910
Long ago, two mighty forces 
waged a blazing battle

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:54.060
that brought absolute 
disaster upon this world.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:57.040
This land became a battlefield,

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:00.460
resulting in nothing but pain and
sadness for the people within it.

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.820
They offered a desperate prayer to the gods.

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:07.420
It was then that the Seraph of Mysteria
descended from the heavens above...

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:11.080
And brought a prompt end to the
blazing battle that had scarred the land.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:16.790
However, a crisis is soon about to
threaten the peace, and only I...

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:20.540
No, only we, can stop it.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:26.040
You might not fully realize the events
that have been set in motion.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:32.130
Even the smallest disagreement can stoke
the flames of hatred that trigger a cycle of violence.

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:35.980
And right now, two opposing forces are about to
arise within our very own academy.

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:38.330
"Two opposing forces"? Does she mean...

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:40.580
The princess and Grea?

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:45.420
Once those forces confront each other,
it will set off a never-ending conflict!

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:48.290
And it will not only engulf our academy,
but the entire world!

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:52.660
At worst, this may bring an age of
grief and despair upon us all!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:56.920
Oh my god, it could mean war
between two major kingdoms...!

00:12:57.210 --> 00:13:00.990
If we turn a blind eye 
here, it will mean that

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:05.090
we have shunned the work and 
prayers of our ancestors.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:09.580
Furthermore, any student that calls
our Mysteria Academy home

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:12.330
is duty bound to protect the peace!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.380
Let us pledge a vow!

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:19.790
Here and now, as your president,
I swear to stand against the coming crisis.

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:22.250
And I want you to stand with me!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.960
Madam President...
I beg you all, please support me.

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:25.500
Ms. Hanna!
I beg you all, please support me.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.750
She's so cool...!

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:33.290
From this moment forth, I will depart on a quest
to protect the peace and safety of our academy!

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.420
Madam President!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.460
I'm going to fight with you!

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.670
Please allow me to join you.
I'm going to fight with you!

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:38.250
Please allow me to join you.
Me too!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.250
I will as well!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.540
Thank you everyone.

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:52.250
I beg your pardon, Your Royal Highnesses!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:54.750
Please listen to what we have to... say.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:58.330
Tea is the best way to warm up, huh?

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:00.540
Yeah, it's just so relaxing.

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:02.540
Huh?

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:03.750
Hanna?

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:06.380
What's going on? What are you all up to?

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:07.960
Oh, I forgot to ask.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.710
Where did you buy these tea leaves from?

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:12.460
Anne and Grea already got over it, I guess!

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:12.460
Well, there's this great tea store in town
that someone recommended!

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:14.670
You should come with me sometime!

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:16.120
Sure, that sounds fun.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.790
My god, how can two princesses
cause so many problems?!

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:22.880
I demand you return all the time
and effort that I just spent!
